  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping and development of a strategy for the management of alien invasive insect pests of Agricultural crops in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the FMoAI to: (i) to assemble and train a team of crop protection practitioners capable of supporting farmers to better manage IAS; and (ii) support the country?s capacity to monitor, report and manage IAS in line with established Good Agricultural Practices (GAP) in the Sub region and Africa as a whole.</narrative>
  </description>
